    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "距上次事件 (ms)",
      "description": "debezium_metrics_MilliSecondsSinceLastEvent (context=streaming)。即使无写入也会增长——防陈旧信号。持续增长且源库有变更 = binlog 拉取停滞。夜间空闲期也会升高，结合断连次数判断。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
